ASM/6800 1.3H4: 0000 ASMIODRIVER        - - - I/O Package for MAL/6800-6809   1.4 - - -
08/16/82 00:00:00; Page 2; Form 1       *** SDOS 1.1 DEFINITIONS ***
SDOSUSERDEFS.ASM
                  1:         PAGE    *** SDOS 1.1 DEFINITIONS ***
                  2: *       SDOS 1.1 DEFINITIONS FILE (AS OF 8/16/82)
                  3: *
  0011            4: SDOSVERSION     EQU     $11     1.1 IN HEX
                  5: *
                  6: *
                  7: *       The Definitions are broken into 3 parts:
                  8: *               A) THOSE NEEDED TO ASSEMBLE SDOS PROPER OR SYSTEM PROGRAMS
                  9: *               B) THOSE NEEDED TO BUILD AN I/O PACKAGE (A SUBSET OF "A")
                 10: *               C) THOSE NEEDED BY EVERYDAY USER PROGRAMS (A SUBSET OF "B")
                 11: *
  00FB           12: SYSCALL$        EQU     $FB     JMP TO SDOS; RESERVED SYSCALL ENTRY POINT
                 13: *       CONTENTS OF ($FC,$FD) POINTS TO END OF USER RAM
                 14: *       CONTENTS OF ($FE,$FF) ARE SACRED; THEY BELONG TO THE ROM




ASM/6800 1.3H4: 0000 ASMIODRIVER        - - - I/O Package for MAL/6800-6809   1.4 - - -
