04C8 08         572:          INX                        COMPUTE REAL START OF THE BUFFER.
04C9 FF0380     573:          STX      WRITEA$BLK+SCBLK:WRBUF     STORE POINTER INTO SCB.
                574:          ;LDX     #WRITEA$BLK       LOAD POINTER TO THE BLOCK,
